{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Holomancer, you are more than a survivor, you are a world-builder, a spell-smith, and a guardian of the last unbroken threads of reality.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Worlds, Infinite Stories</strong><br>Traverse a procedurally generated planet that grows with each playthrough. From crystalline deserts to haunted forests, every biome offers new challenges, resources, and secrets to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft. Build. Reshape.</strong><br>Harness magic and technology alike. Forge weapons, construct strongholds, and design your avatar with gear that reflects your path, warrior, mage, inventor, or something entirely your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Corruption</strong><br>Face relentless enemies born of a spreading corruption. Engage them with ranged firepower, devastating spells, or summoned constructs. Combat is fast, tactical, and ever-shifting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living Lore</strong><br>Villages rise, quests unfold, and stories intertwine as you explore. The choices you make shape not just your character, but the world itself.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3259530?t=1764012402","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259530/1adc6c58b6ae584df87683f4c23930e140747ae8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764012402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259530/0abedb24590eee2e7b7c6f80cbf1ea88fc6684da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764012402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259530/0abedb24590eee2e7b7c6f80cbf1ea88fc6684da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764012402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},